            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"choose-the-backend-before-import\">Choose the backend before import</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The first code cell sets <code>PYRITE_MC_BACKEND</code> to <code>cpu</code> unless the environment\nalready selected another backend. For GPU execution, set it to <code>cuda</code> <strong>before\nimporting PyRITE</strong>. Restart the kernel after changing the backend or installing\nCuPy; rerunning a later cell does not undo imports cached in a live kernel.\nThe smoke result below records the actual backend, which should match your\nselection. <code>nvidia-smi</code> confirms driver/GPU visibility; importing CuPy alone\ndoes not prove a compatible device exists.</span></span>"
          }
        }
